---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "News"
description: "Pre-launch updates from the Uncost movement — what we have published and why, dated and honest about what is and isn't done."
---
<section class="blk blk--first">
  <p class="eyebrow">News</p>
  <h1 class="sec">News.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Pre-launch updates from the movement — what we’ve published and why. Dated, and honest about what is and isn’t done.</p>
</section>

<section class="blk">
  <p class="eyebrow">Updates</p>
  <h2 class="sec">Movement updates.</h2>
  {% for item in news %}
  <article class="news-item">
    <h3>{{ item.title }}</h3>
    <p class="news-date"><time datetime="{{ item.dateISO }}">{{ item.date }}</time></p>
    <p>{{ item.body }}</p>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>

<section class="blk blk--ink">
  <p class="eyebrow">Get updates</p>
  <h2 class="sec">Stay in the loop.</h2>
  <p>Email updates open when there’s a real route for them. For now, signing the pledge is how to be counted — and this page and its <a href="/news/feed.xml">RSS feed</a> are where new updates land.</p>
  <div class="cta-actions">
    <a href="/pledge" class="u-btn u-btn--primary">Sign the Pledge</a>
    <a href="/join" class="u-btn u-btn--outline-cream">Take part</a>
  </div>
</section>
